COMMUNITY RECREATION AND EVENTS DEPARTMENT
ICE AND EVENTS CENTER USER AGREEMENT
This Agreement (Agreement”)is made and entered into this 29h day of May,2018, by and
between the Cityof Cheyenne, a municipal corporation organized under thelaws of the State of
Wyoming(City”),2101O'Neil Avenue, Cheyenne, Wyoming82001, and Cheyenne Stampede
Junior“AHockey LLC, a limited liability company organized under the laws of the State of
Wyoming(Cheyenne Stampede”), having its principal office at 3303Forest Drive, Cheyenne,
Wyoming 82001.This Agreement pertains to the City of Cheyenne Ice and Events Center(*Events
Center")locatedat1530West Lincoln way, Cheyenne, Wyoming.The Events Center is administered
by the Cityof Cheyenne Community Recreation and Events Department.
WHEREAS, the Cityowns, manages, and operates the Events Centerand has the powerand
authority to lease the use there of to others for the purpose of conducting certain events andother
activities; and
WHEREAS, Cheyenne Stampede desires to use certain portions of the Events Center as
indicated on Appendix A to this Agreement and the City desires tolicense the use thereof to
Cheyenne Stampede, for the purpose of holding and presenting Junior“A”Hockey practices and
games (collectively referred to herein as the “Season"), all subject to the terms and conditions set
forth in this Agreement.
NOW, THEREFORE, in consideration of the covenants and agreements contained herein,
and intending tobe legally bound hereby, the parties agree asfollows:
1.Premises: City hereby grants to Cheyenne Stampede, permission touse those
portions of the Events Center setforth on AppendixA, attached hereto and incorporated herein
(Premises"), upon the terms and conditions contained herein.Only Cheyenne Stampede members,
designated representatives and invitees are permitted by this Agreement touse the Premises.
2.Term: The period of Cheyenne Stampede'suse of the Premises shall be from May
29,2018 through March 30,2020 (Term").Before the commencement of the Term of this
Agreement asset forth in Appendix A, the City shall make the Events Center available to Cheyenne
Stampede, upon thepayment ofseparate and additional charges, for(i)preparation for the Season
and delivery, move-in and set-upof Cheyenne Stampede property and equipment; and(i) load-out
immediately following the conclusion of the Season, ending no later than the time set forth on
Appendix A.Unless expressly stated herein, or otherwise agreed to in writing, all deliveries and
items required for presentation of the Season shallbe provided at the sole cost and expense of
Cheyenne Stampede.
